      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Reports with the contracting agency, or as may be directed by the City Administrator. Compliance Reports shall be filed within such time and shall contain such information as to the practices, policies, programs, employment policies, and employment statistics of the contractor and each subcontractor, and shall be in such form, as the City Administrator may prescribe.",
